{
  "id": "PRO.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbs 1",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The proverbs of Solomon the son of David, king of Israel;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To know wisdom and instruction; to perceive the words of understanding;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To receive the instruction of wisdom, justice, and judgment, and equity;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To give subtilty to the simple, to the young man knowledge and discretion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A wise",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "man",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.1.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.1.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will hear, and will increase learning; and a man of understanding shall attain unto wise counsels:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To understand a proverb, and the interpretation; the words of the wise, and their dark sayings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ The fear of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.1.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.1.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.1.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.1.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the beginning of knowledge:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.1.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.1.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fools despise wisdom and instruction.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My son, hear the instruction of thy father, and forsake not the law of thy mother:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an ornament of grace unto thy head, and chains about thy neck.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ My son, if sinners entice thee, consent thou not.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If they say, Come with us, let us lay wait for blood, let us lurk privily for the innocent without cause:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let us swallow them up alive as the grave; and whole, as those that go down into the pit:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We shall find all precious substance, we shall fill our houses with spoil:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cast in thy lot among us; let us all have one purse:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My son, walk not thou in the way with them; refrain thy foot from their path:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For their feet run to evil, and make haste to shed blood.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Surely in vain the net is spread in the sight of any bird.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they lay wait for their",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "own",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.1.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.1.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "blood; they lurk privily for their",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "own",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.1.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.1.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lives.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.1.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.1.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the ways of every one that is greedy of gain;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.1.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.1.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "taketh away the life of the owners thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Wisdom crieth without; she uttereth her voice in the streets:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She crieth in the chief place of concourse, in the openings of the gates: in the city she uttereth her words,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "saying",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.1.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.1.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How long, ye simple ones, will ye love simplicity? and the scorners delight in their scorning, and fools hate knowledge?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Turn you at my reproof: behold, I will pour out my spirit unto you, I will make known my words unto you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Because I have called, and ye refused; I have stretched out my hand, and no man regarded;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But ye have set at nought all my counsel, and would none of my reproof:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I also will laugh at your calamity; I will mock when your fear cometh;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When your fear cometh as desolation, and your destruction cometh as a whirlwind; when distress and anguish cometh upon you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then shall they call upon me, but I will not answer; they shall seek me early, but they shall not find me:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For that they hated knowledge, and did not choose the fear of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.1.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.1.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ":",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They would none of my counsel: they despised all my reproof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore shall they eat of the fruit of their own way, and be filled with their own devices.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the turning away of the simple shall slay them, and the prosperity of fools shall destroy them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But whoso hearkeneth unto me shall dwell safely, and shall be quiet from fear of evil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
